## 9. Virtual File System (`lge_vfs.h`)

**Lucid namespace:** `api.fs`

Unified file access. In development, reads loose files from a directory. In a shipped game, reads from an AES-256 encrypted `.pck` bundle — same API, same call sites, different backend. Raw OS file paths are never used outside this module.

### Types

```cpp
using VFSFile = uint32_t;
#define LGE_INVALID_FILE ((VFSFile)0)
```

### Functions

```cpp
