### Lucid-side (`api.fs`)

```lucid
-- Read a file
let data [byte] = api.fs:read_file("config/settings.json")

-- Write a file (editor/dev only)
api.fs:write_file("exports/level_01.lmap", level_bytes)

-- Check existence
if api.fs:exists("saves/slot_1.sav") {
    load_save("saves/slot_1.sav")
}

-- List a directory
api.fs:list_dir("textures/", (name string, is_dir bool) = {
    if !is_dir {
        api.console:log("Found texture: " + name)
    }
})

-- File save dialog (editor only — opens OS native dialog)
let path string = api.fs:show_save_dialog("Save Level", ".lmap")
```

### Notes
- `LGE_VFS_Write`, `LGE_VFS_MakeDir`, `LGE_VFS_Delete`, and `LGE_VFS_ListDir` are only available in development builds. They silently fail (return false / no-op) in shipped games.
- All paths are forward-slash separated regardless of OS: `"audio/sfx/shot.lsfx"`, not `"audio\\sfx\\shot.lsfx"`.
- `.pck` files are decrypted in RAM only — decrypted content is never written to disk.

