**Lucid namespace:** `api.console` / `api.commands`

A live function-table command system. Every registered command is a named C++ or Lucid callback. Typing a command in the editor console or calling `LGE_Console_Exec` calls it directly — no text parsing, no eval, no intermediate layer.

### Functions

```cpp
